// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/ext_power.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

#define Base        0
#define Function    1
#define Navigation  2
#define Media       3
#define Numeral     4
#define Symbols     5
#define Button      6
#define Game        7
#define Gameplus    8

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };
    };

    combos { compatible = "zmk,combos"; };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            label = "Base";
            bindings = <
       &kp Q       &kp W       &kp E        &kp R         &kp T        &kp Y      &kp U        &kp I        &kp O       &kp P
       &hm LGUI A  &hm LALT S  &hm LCTRL D  &hm LSHIFT F  &kp G        &kp H      &hm RSHFT J  &hm RCTRL K  &hm RALT L  &hm RGUI SEMICOLON
&mo 1  &kp Z       &kp X       &kp C        &kp V         &kp B        &kp N      &kp M        &kp COMMA    &kp DOT     &kp SLASH           &lt 6 APOSTROPHE
                               &lt 3 ESC    &lt 2 SPACE   &lt 1 TAB    &lt 5 RET  &lt 4 BSPC   &kp MINUS
            >;
        };

        Function {
            label = "Function";
            bindings = <
        &none     &none     &none      &none      &none     &kp PRINTSCREEN  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &kp F12
        &kp LGUI  &kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LSHFT  &to 7     &kp SCROLLLOCK   &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &kp F11
&trans  &none     &none     &none      &none      &none     &kp PAUSE_BREAK  &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F10  &trans
                            &none      &none      &trans    &none            &none   &trans
            >;
        };

        Navigation {
            label = "Navigation";
            bindings = <
        &none     &none     &none      &none      &none    &none         &none     &none      &none      &none
        &kp LGUI  &kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LSHFT  &none    &kp CAPSLOCK  &kp LEFT  &kp DOWN   &kp UP     &kp RIGHT
&trans  &none     &none     &none      &none      &none    &kp INSERT    &kp HOME  &kp PG_DN  &kp PG_UP  &kp END    &trans
                            &none      &trans     &none    &kp RET       &kp BSPC  &trans
            >;
        };

        Media {
            label = "Media";
            bindings = <
        &none       &none         &none       &none             &none          &none        &none             &none       &none         &none
        &kp C_PREV  &kp C_VOL_DN  &kp C_MUTE  &kp C_VOL_UP      &kp C_NEXT     &kp C_PREV   &kp C_VOL_DN      &kp C_MUTE  &kp C_VOL_UP  &kp C_NEXT
&trans  &none       &none         &none       &none             &bootloader    &bootloader  &none             &none       &none         &none       &trans
                                  &trans      &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &kp C_STOP     &kp C_STOP   &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &trans
            >;
        };

        Numeral {
            label = "Numeral";
            bindings = <
        &kp LBKT       &kp N7  &kp N8   &kp N9  &kp RBKT         &none  &none      &none      &none     &none
        &kp SEMICOLON  &kp N4  &kp N5   &kp N6  &kp EQUAL        &none  &kp LSHFT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LALT  &kp LGUI
&trans  &kp GRAVE      &kp N1  &kp N2   &kp N3  &kp BACKSLASH    &none  &none      &none      &none     &none     &trans
                               &kp DOT  &kp N0  &kp MINUS        &none  &trans     &trans
            >;
        };

        Symbols {
            label = "Symbols";
            bindings = <
        &kp LBRC   &kp AMPS    &kp ASTRK    &kp LPAR   &kp RBRC     &none   &none      &none      &none     &none
        &kp COLON  &kp DOLLAR  &kp PERCENT  &kp CARET  &kp PLUS     &none   &kp LSHFT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LALT  &kp LGUI
&trans  &kp TILDE  &kp EXCL    &kp AT       &kp HASH   &kp PIPE     &none   &none      &none      &none     &none     &trans
                               &kp LPAR     &kp RPAR   &kp UNDER    &trans  &none      &trans
            >;
        };

        Button {
            label = "Button";
            bindings = <
             &bt BT_CLR         &trans    &trans     &trans      &bt BT_SEL 0    &bt BT_SEL 3  &trans            &trans      &bootloader  &trans
             &kp LGUI           &kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LSHIFT  &bt BT_SEL 1    &bt BT_SEL 4  &kp RSHIFT        &kp RCTRL   &kp RALT     &kp RGUI
&bootloader  &ext_power EP_TOG  &trans    &trans     &trans      &bt BT_SEL 2    &trans        &trans            &trans      &trans       &trans    &trans
                                          &trans     &trans      &trans          &kp C_PREV    &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &kp C_NEXT
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            bindings = <
            &trans          &kp Q   &kp W      &kp E      &kp R     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
            &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp A   &kp S      &kp D      &mo 8     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp ESCAPE  &trans          &trans  &trans     &trans     &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                    &kp LCTRL  &kp SPACE  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;

            label = "Gaming";
        };

        Gaming+ {
            bindings = <
         &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp LC(RA(DEL))
         &kp L         &kp O         &kp Y         &kp K         &kp G           &kp F5  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp TAB  &to 0         &trans        &trans        &kp NUMBER_6  &kp NUMBER_7    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans           &kp LA(F4)
                                     &kp J         &kp I         &kp M           &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;

            label = "Gaming+";
        };
    };
};
